        "meta_descr": "Ashley O'Mahony | Data Science & AI Leader | Monopoly GO @ Scopely\nStrategy, Org Building & Player Intelligence | Engineering → Supply Chain → Banking → Gaming → Data & AI\nInt'l MBA | MSc in Big Data | MSc in Industrial Engineering\n\nHis professional experience, his educational background, his passion for photography, and his contact details.\n\nDownload his full resume I ashleyomahony.com",
