          },
          "_tags": [
            "Theme"
          ],
          "_name": "header3",
          "_anchor": "header3-g",
          "_params": {
            "showMeta": false,
            "paddingTop": 1,
            "paddingBottom": 1,
            "bgColor": "#efefef"
          },
          "title": "EXPERIENCE",
          "meta": ""
        },
        {
          "_params": {
            "paddingTop": "2",
            "paddingBottom": 1,
            "bgColor": "#fff"
          },
          "text1": "<p><b style=\"font-size: 1.07rem; line-height: 1.5;\">DATA SCIENCE MANAGER</b></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 1.07rem; line-height: 1.5;\">Sep 2024 - Now</span><br></p>",
          "text2": "<p><b>MONOPOLY GO!</b> | <b>SCOPELY</b>&nbsp;| <b>Barcelona</b> | <b>Spain</b></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 17.12px;\">I lead the data science team behind one of the highest-grossing mobile games ever&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 17.12px;\">made. Matchmaking and game-economy simulation are now capabilities other teams rely&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 17.12px;\">on, and Players Profiler — a segmentation framework I proposed, got funded and now&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 17.12px;\">lead — is one of the bigger things on our 2026 roadmap. I also like planting ideas&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 17.12px;\">in teams I don't run: a social-dynamics initiative running elsewhere started as a&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 17.12px;\">case I kept making until the Leads there took it on. Lately I've been building AI&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 17.12px;\">tooling as an internal product.</span></p><p><i style=\"font-size: 1.07rem; line-height: 1.5;\"><a href=\"https://www.monopolygo.com/\" target=\"_blank\">monopolygo.com</a></i><br></p>",
          "_tags": [
            "Theme"
          ],
          "_name": "content6",
          "_styles": {
            "P": {
              "text-align": "left",
              "font-size": "17px"
            }
          },
          "_anchor": "content6-2w"
        },
        {
          "_params": {
            "paddingTop": "2",
            "paddingBottom": 1,
            "bgColor": "#fff"
          },
          "text1": "<p><b style=\"font-size: 1.07rem; line-height: 1.5;\">LEAD DATA SCIENTIST</b></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 1.07rem; line-height: 1.5;\">Apr 2022 - Aug 2024</span><br></p>",
          "text2": "<p><b>PLAYGAMI</b>&nbsp;|&nbsp;<b>SCOPELY</b> | <b>Barcelona</b>&nbsp;| <b>Spain</b></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 17.12px;\">Central ML platform serving Scopely's game portfolio. I co-led the function after&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 17.12px;\">the Director left and wasn't replaced, and spent most of my time on a problem that&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 17.12px;\">wasn't in the job description: a platform team was building products without knowing&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 17.12px;\">what the games needed. Fixing that produced most of what we shipped — matchmaking,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 17.12px;\">churn intercept, the cost work that paid for itself.</span></p><p><i style=\"font-size: 1.07rem; line-height: 1.5;\"><a href=\"https://www.scopely.com\" target=\"_blank\">scopely.com</a></i><br></p>",
          "_tags": [
            "Theme"
          ],
          "_name": "content6",
          "_styles": {
            "P": {
              "text-align": "left",
              "font-size": "17px"
            }
          },
          "_anchor": "content6-2x"
        },
        {
          "_params": {
            "paddingTop": "2",
            "paddingBottom": 1,
            "bgColor": "#fff"
          },
          "text1": "<p><b style=\"font-size: 1.07rem; line-height: 1.5;\">TEAM LEAD | DATA SCIENTIST</b></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 1.07rem; line-height: 1.5;\">Jul 2021 - Apr 2022</span><br></p>",
          "text2": "<p><b>BNP PARIBAS</b> | <b>Madrid</b> | <b>Spain</b></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 1.07rem; line-height: 1.5;\">RISK Artificial Intelligence Research</span><br></p><p><i>Manage a team of 5 data experts: Data Business Analysts, Data Scientists, Data Engineers.</i></p><p><i>Undertake to close the Gender Pay Gap at RISK France (1,500 employees) by comparing salaries of employees with similar profiles, using a scikit-learn k-Nearest Neighbors regression (kNN), distributing the results through R Markdown reports and a Dash application, and protecting data confidentiality through an encryption strategy.</i></p><p><i>Join the Junior RISK Executive Board to promote and implement new ways of working (Agile, Lean…).</i><br></p><p><i style=\"font-size: 1.07rem; line-height: 1.5;\"><a href=\"http://www.keedio.com\" target=\"_blank\">group.bnpparibas</a></i><br></p>",
          "_tags": [
            "Theme"
          ],
          "_name": "content6",
          "_styles": {
            "P": {
              "text-align": "left",
              "font-size": "17px"
            }
          },
          "_anchor": "content6-2v"
        },
        {
          "_params": {
            "paddingTop": "2",
            "paddingBottom": 1,
            "bgColor": "#fff"
          },
          "text1": "<p><b style=\"font-size: 1.07rem; line-height: 1.5;\">DATA SCIENTIST</b></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 1.07rem; line-height: 1.5;\">May 2020 - Jun 2021</span><br></p>",
          "text2": "<p><b>BNP PARIBAS</b> | <b>Madrid</b> | <b>Spain</b></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 1.07rem; line-height: 1.5;\">RISK Artificial Intelligence Research</span><br></p><p><i>Develop a model for predicting incomes of micro-companies by aggregating transactional data (12m transactions, 32k features), using scikit-learn and XGBoost ensemble-based regression algorithms.</i></p><p><i>Develop a Minimum Viable Product (MVP) identifying duplicates in a database compiling information related to French company executives and shareholders (22m records) using recorlinkage, SQLite and Flask.</i></p><p><i>Produce guidelines for Model Risk Management with associated scorecard and documentation template.</i></p><p><i style=\"font-size: 1.07rem; line-height: 1.5;\"><a href=\"http://www.keedio.com\" target=\"_blank\">group.bnpparibas</a></i><br></p>",
          "_tags": [
            "Theme"
          ],
          "_name": "content6",
          "_styles": {
            "P": {
              "text-align": "left",
              "font-size": "17px"
            }
          },
          "_anchor": "content6-2u"
        },
        {
          "_params": {
            "paddingTop": "2",
            "paddingBottom": 1,
            "bgColor": "#fff"
          },
          "text1": "<p><b style=\"font-size: 1.07rem; line-height: 1.5;\">DATA SCIENTIST | BIG DATA ANALYST</b></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 1.07rem; line-height: 1.5;\">Oct 2019 - Apr 2020</span><br></p>",
          "text2": "<p><b>KEEDIO</b> | <b>Madrid</b> | <b>Spain</b></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 1.07rem; line-height: 1.5;\">Log Analytics for KloudSense</span><br></p><p><i>Build the Log Anomaly Detection model for KloudSense, the Cloud Native Observability Platform developed by Keedio for monitoring, alerting, analytics and prediction of Big Data clusters state.</i></p><p><i>Create the data ingestion pipeline with rsyslog and CrateDB, then deploy it on the cluster using Ansible.</i></p><p><i>Apply Natural Language Processing techniques (NLP) with Python and Spark, using Plotly for data visualization.</i></p><p><i style=\"font-size: 1.07rem; line-height: 1.5;\"><a href=\"http://www.keedio.com\" target=\"_blank\">www.keedio.com</a></i><br></p>",
          "_tags": [
            "Theme"
          ],
          "_name": "content6",
          "_styles": {
            "P": {
              "text-align": "left",
              "font-size": "17px"
            }
          },
          "_anchor": "content6-2t"
        },
        {
          "_tags": [
            "Theme"
          ],
          "_name": "content6",
          "_styles": {
            "P": {
              "text-align": "left",
              "font-size": "17px"
            }
          },
          "_anchor": "content6-j",
          "_params": {
            "paddingTop": "2",
            "paddingBottom": 1,
            "bgColor": "#fff"
          },
          "text1": "<p><b style=\"font-size: 1.07rem; line-height: 1.5;\">GLOBAL COMMERCIAL ANALYST</b></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 1.07rem; line-height: 1.5;\">Feb 2016 - Dec 2017</span><br></p>",
          "text2": "<p><b>MOTHERCARE</b> | <b>London</b> | <b>UK</b></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 1.07rem; line-height: 1.5;\">Subject-Matter Expert Sourcing&nbsp;-&nbsp;Oracle Retail Project</span><br></p><p><i>Represent the Sourcing Division in the Oracle Retail implementation project, acting as a cross-functional liaison between operational departments and the programme team, reporting progression, challenges and successes.</i></p><p><i>Challenge ways of working, documenting new process design and functionalities requirements, leading in delivery of Quick Wins solutions, ensuring implementation of consistent and repeatable methods company-wide.</i></p><p><i style=\"font-size: 1.07rem; line-height: 1.5;\"><a href=\"http://www.mothercare.com\" target=\"_blank\">www.mothercare.com</a></i><br></p>"
        },
        {
          "_tags": [
            "Theme"
          ],
          "_name": "content6",
          "_anchor": "content6-n",
          "_params": {
            "paddingTop": 1,
            "paddingBottom": 1,
            "bgColor": "#fff"
          },
          "text1": "<p><b style=\"font-size: 1.07rem; line-height: 1.5;\">GLOBAL ANALYST</b></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 1.07rem; line-height: 1.5;\">Sep 2013 - Jan 2016</span><br></p>",
          "text2": "<p><b>MOTHERCARE</b> | <b>Hong Kong</b>&nbsp;| <b>China</b></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 1.07rem; line-height: 1.5;\">Business Analysis - Vendor Management</span></p><p><i style=\"font-size: 1.07rem;\">Analyse and transform business data, monitor and communicate on key metrics across all Sourcing divisions (sales, stocks, quality, profit) to influence and ensure delivery against business plan.</i></p><p><i style=\"font-size: 1.07rem;\">Define business and supplier strategy in conjunction with the Sourcing Heads, for each country and product category, based on quotation data and potential gains.</i></p><p><i style=\"font-size: 1.07rem;\">Supervise outsourced developers and collaborate with IT teams to adjust existing systems and databases to improve processes efficiency, ensure accuracy of reports and provide actionable insights.</i></p><p><i style=\"font-size: 1.07rem;\"><a href=\"http://www.mothercare.com\" target=\"_blank\">www.mothercare.com</a></i><br></p>"
        },
        {
          "_tags": [
            "Theme"
          ],
          "_name": "content6",
          "_anchor": "content6-r",
          "_params": {
            "paddingTop": 1,
            "paddingBottom": 1,
            "bgColor": "#fff"
          },
          "text1": "<p><span style=\"font-size: 1.07rem; line-height: 1.5;\"><b>TRIMS &amp; FURNITURE MANAGER</b></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 1.07rem; line-height: 1.5;\">Feb 2012 - Dec 2012</span><br></p>",
          "text2": "<p><b>DEVANLAY LACOSTE</b> | <b>Hong Kong</b>&nbsp;| <b>China</b></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 1.07rem;\">Trims, Furniture and Point-Of-Sales Materials Purchasing</span><br></p><p><i style=\"font-size: 1.07rem; line-height: 1.5;\">Manage and coach a team of 7 people based in Shanghai, securing procurement flows and inventory of Lacoste logos and trims, mentoring and recruiting new members to put into practice new business activities.</i></p><p><i style=\"font-size: 1.07rem; line-height: 1.5;\">Improve care label supply by defining data standards and setting up a single provider for the APAC region.</i></p><p><i style=\"font-size: 1.07rem; line-height: 1.5;\">Implement sourcing processes of furniture and Point-Of-Sales materials for all shops in APAC region.</i></p><p><i style=\"font-size: 1.07rem; line-height: 1.5;\">Take ownership of the Support Service for the Lacoste Asian Production Licensees, providing technical assistance and procurement service, and focusing on restoring business value and customer satisfaction.</i></p><p><a href=\"http://www.lacoste.com/\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"font-size: 1.07rem; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">www.lacoste.com</a><br></p>"
        },
        {
          "_tags": [
            "Theme"
          ],
          "_name": "content6",
          "_anchor": "content6-s",
          "_params": {
            "paddingTop": 1,
            "paddingBottom": 1,
            "bgColor": "#fff"
          },
          "text1": "<p><span style=\"font-size: 1.07rem; line-height: 1.5;\"><b>BUSINESS ANALYST</b></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 1.07rem; line-height: 1.5;\">Feb 2011 - Jan 2012</span><br></p>",
          "text2": "<p><b>DEVANLAY LACOSTE</b> | <b>Hong Kong</b>&nbsp;| <b>China</b></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 1.07rem; line-height: 1.5;\">Reporting - Supply Chain&nbsp;Planning -&nbsp;Project Management</span></p><p><i style=\"font-size: 1.07rem;\">Direct the Asian platform reporting to senior executives (C-level), identifying relevant data, defining the most critical KPIs, designing dashboards, highlighting deviations and prescribing corrective actions.</i></p><p><i style=\"font-size: 1.07rem;\">Conduct Sales and Operations Planning meetings (S&amp;OP), controlling alignment of commercial, production and supply chain plans, continuously improving the method in concert with the Supply Chain Director and local teams.</i></p><p><i>Lead the care labels standardization for APAC, complying with legal and distribution constraints, and deploying an ordering web interface to 40 Asian suppliers.</i></p><p><a href=\"http://www.lacoste.com/\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"font-size: 1.07rem; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 1.5;\">www.lacoste.com</a><br></p>"
        },
        {
          "_tags": [
            "Theme"
          ],
          "_name": "content6",
          "_anchor": "content6-u",
          "_params": {
            "paddingTop": 1,
            "paddingBottom": 1,
            "bgColor": "#fff"
          },
          "text1": "<p><span style=\"font-size: 1.07rem; line-height: 1.5;\"><b>SUPPLY CHAIN ENGINEER</b></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 1.07rem; line-height: 1.5;\">Oct 2009 - Jan 2011</span><br></p>",
          "text2": "<p><b>DEVANLAY LACOSTE</b> | <b>Shanghai</b>&nbsp;| <b>China</b></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 1.07rem; line-height: 1.5;\">Organisation Processes Audits - Suppliers Management</span></p><p><i>Perform selective audits in several areas including supply chain, logistics, supplier management and quality, and propose solutions and tools to improve procedures efficiency and performance.</i></p><p><i>Standardize supplier relationship management processes by building a performance evaluation tool in Excel VBA, and regularizing contracts terms and conditions and social compliance certificates.</i></p><p><a href=\"http://www.lacoste.com/\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"font-size: 1.07rem; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 1.5;\">www.lacoste.com</a><br></p>"
        },
        {
          "_tags": [
            "Theme"
          ],
          "_name": "content6",
          "_anchor": "content6-v",
          "_params": {
            "paddingTop": 1,
            "paddingBottom": "5",
            "bgColor": "#fff"
          },
          "text1": "<p><span style=\"font-size: 1.07rem; line-height: 1.5;\"><b>SUPPLY CHAIN AND PROJECT MANAGEMENT ENGINEER</b></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 1.07rem; line-height: 1.5;\">Oct 2007 - May 2009</span><br></p>",
          "text2": "<p><b>LGM GROUP</b> | <b>Paris</b>&nbsp;| <b>France</b></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 1.07rem; line-height: 1.5;\"><a href=\"http://www.lgmgroup.fr\" target=\"_blank\">www.lgmgroup.fr</a></span><br></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 1.07rem; line-height: 1.5;\">SNCF - Simulation of Logistics Flows in Maintenance Centres</span></p><p><i>Optimize logistics flows in 26 French train maintenance centres by collecting data, building data analytics tools (Excel VBA), modelling new scenarios in ExtendSim, and training client teams.</i></p><p><a href=\"http://www.sncf.com\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"font-size: 1.07rem; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">www.sncf.com</a><br></p><p><i></i></p><p>Renault Trucks Défense - Project Management Support</p><p><i>Support project managers of Engineering and Design Department by developing project management tools (Excel), watching costs (€3.5m budget), planning, resources, and action plans (Microsoft Project), coordinating prototype parts stock and communicating about risks and opportunities.</i></p><p><a href=\"http://www.renault-trucks-defense.eu\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"font-size: 1.07rem; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">www.renault-trucks-defense.eu</a><br></p><p><a href=\"www.renault-trucks-defense.eu\" target=\"_blank\"></a></p>"
        },
        {
          "_styles": {
            ".mbr-section-title, .mbr-section-subtitle": {
              "text-align": "center"
            }
          },
          "_tags": [
            "Theme"
          ],
          "_name": "header3",
          "_anchor": "header3-12",
          "_params": {
            "showMeta": false,
            "paddingTop": 1,
            "paddingBottom": "2",
            "bgColor": "#fff"
          },
          "title": "",
          "meta": ""
        },
        {
          "_styles": {
            ".mbr-section-title, .mbr-section-subtitle": {
              "text-align": "center"
            }
          },
          "_tags": [
            "Theme"
          ],
          "_name": "header3",
          "_anchor": "header3-w",
          "_params": {
            "showMeta": false,
            "paddingTop": 1,
            "paddingBottom": 1,
            "bgColor": "#efefef"
          },
          "title": "EDUCATION",
          "meta": ""
        },
        {
          "_params": {
            "paddingTop": "2",
            "paddingBottom": 1,
            "bgColor": "#fff"
          },
          "text1": "<p><span style=\"font-size: 1.07rem;\"><b>MASTER IN BUSINESS ANALYTICS AND BIG DATA</b></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 1.07rem;\">Oct 2018 - Jul 2019</span><br></p>",
          "text2": "<p><b>IE SCHOOL OF HUMAN SCIENCES &amp; TECHNOLOGY</b>&nbsp;| <b>Madrid</b>&nbsp;| <b>Spain</b></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 1.07rem; line-height: 1.5;\">#3 European Master, #10 Worldwide - <a href=\"https://www.topuniversities.com/university-rankings/business-masters-rankings/business-analytics/2018\" target=\"_blank\">QS World Ranking 2018</a></span><br></p><p><i>President of IE Technology and Innovation Club</i></p><p><i>President of IE Photography Club</i></p><p><a href=\"http://www.ie.edu\" target=\"_blank\">www.ie.edu</a><br></p>",
          "_tags": [
            "Theme"
          ],
          "_name": "content6",
          "_anchor": "content6-2d"
        },
        {
          "_params": {
            "paddingTop": "2",
            "paddingBottom": 1,
            "bgColor": "#fff"
          },
          "text1": "<p><span style=\"font-size: 1.07rem;\"><b>INTERNATIONAL MBA</b></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 1.07rem;\">Jan 2018 - Jul 2018</span><br></p>",
          "text2": "<p><b>IE BUSINESS SCHOOL</b>&nbsp;| <b>Madrid</b>&nbsp;| <b>Spain</b></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 1.07rem; line-height: 1.5;\">#3 European Business School, #8 Worldwide - <a href=\"http://rankings.ft.com/businessschoolrankings/ie-business-school\" target=\"_blank\">FT Ranking 2017</a></span><br></p><p><a href=\"http://www.ie.edu\" target=\"_blank\">www.ie.edu</a><br></p>",
          "_tags": [
            "Theme"
          ],
          "_name": "content6",
          "_anchor": "content6-2b"
        },
        {
          "_tags": [
            "Theme"
          ],
          "_name": "content6",
          "_anchor": "content6-x",
          "_params": {
            "paddingTop": "2",
            "paddingBottom": 1,
            "bgColor": "#fff"
          },
          "text1": "<p><span style=\"font-size: 1.07rem; line-height: 1.5;\"><b>MASTER'S DEGREE IN INDUSTRIAL ENGINEERING</b></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 1.07rem; line-height: 1.5;\">2003 - 2007</span><br></p>",
          "text2": "<p><b>IMT MINES ALBI-CARMAUX</b> | <b>Albi</b>&nbsp;| <b>France</b></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 1.07rem; line-height: 1.5;\">Graduate School of Engineering - French 'Grandes Ecoles'</span><br></p><p><a href=\"http://www.mines-albi.fr\" target=\"_blank\">www.mines-albi.fr</a><a href=\"http://www.lacoste.com/\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"font-size: 1.07rem; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 1.5;\"></a><br></p>"
        },
        {
          "_tags": [
            "Theme"
          ],
          "_name": "content6",
          "_anchor": "content6-y",
          "_params": {
            "paddingTop": 1,
            "paddingBottom": 1,
            "bgColor": "#fff"
          },
          "text1": "<p><span style=\"font-size: 1.07rem; line-height: 1.5;\"><b>INTERNSHIP</b></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 1.07rem; line-height: 1.5;\">Feb 2007 - Jul 2007</span><br></p>",
          "text2": "<p><b>ISA FRANCE</b> | <b>Besançon</b>&nbsp;| <b>France</b></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 1.07rem; line-height: 1.5;\">Initialization of the ERP Implementation</span></p><p><i>Audit the decision process.&nbsp;</i><i style=\"font-size: 1.07rem; line-height: 1.5;\">Collect production key-data.&nbsp;</i><i style=\"font-size: 1.07rem; line-height: 1.5;\">Develop a planning tool (Excel VBA).&nbsp;</i><i style=\"font-size: 1.07rem; line-height: 1.5;\">Train the final users.</i></p><p><a href=\"http://www.isafrance.com/en/home.html\" target=\"_blank\">www.isafrance.com</a><a href=\"http://www.lacoste.com/\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"font-size: 1.07rem; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 1.5;\"></a><br></p>"
        },
        {
          "_tags": [
            "Theme"
          ],
          "_name": "content6",
          "_anchor": "content6-z",
          "_params": {
            "paddingTop": 1,
            "paddingBottom": 1,
            "bgColor": "#fff"
          },
          "text1": "<p><span style=\"font-size: 1.07rem; line-height: 1.5;\"><b>INTERNSHIP</b></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 1.07rem; line-height: 1.5;\">May 2006 - Aug 2006</span><br></p>",
          "text2": "<p><b>EMR</b> | <b>La Réunion</b>&nbsp;| <b>France</b></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 1.07rem; line-height: 1.5;\">Reengineering of the Core-Business Process</span></p><p><i>Redefine physical and information flows. Write job descriptions and procedures, and organize the shared network. Set up inventory and quality management tools. Design a CRM model.</i></p><p><a href=\"http://www.emr-oi.com/\" target=\"_blank\">www.emr-oi.com</a><a href=\"http://www.isafrance.com/en/home.html\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"font-size: 1.07rem; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 1.5;\"></a><br></p>"
        },
        {
          "_tags": [
            "Theme"
          ],
          "_name": "content6",
          "_anchor": "content6-10",
          "_params": {
            "paddingTop": 1,
            "paddingBottom": "5",
            "bgColor": "#fff"
          },
          "text1": "<p><span style=\"font-size: 1.07rem; line-height: 1.5;\"><b>INTERNSHIP</b></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 1.07rem; line-height: 1.5;\">May 2005 - Aug 2005</span><br></p>",
          "text2": "<p><b>BOSCH REXROTH</b> | <b>Lyon</b>&nbsp;| <b>France</b></p><p>Stock Accuracy Project</p><p><i>Support new process execution by auditing production lines, creating tailored forms and training staffs to ERP (SAP).</i></p><p><a href=\"https://www.boschrexroth.com/\" target=\"_blank\">www.boschrexroth.com</a><a href=\"http://www.isafrance.com/en/home.html\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"font-size: 1.07rem; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 1.5;\"></a><br></p>"
        },
