          "text1": "<h2>ASHLEY O'MAHONY</h2>",
          "text2": "<p><span style=\"font-size: 1.07rem;\">DATA SCIENCE &amp; AI LEADER | MONOPOLY GO @ SCOPELY</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 1.07rem;\">Strategy, Org Building &amp; Player Intelligence</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 1.07rem;\"><i>Engineering → Supply Chain → Banking → Gaming → Data &amp; AI</i></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 1.07rem;\"><i><br></i></span></p><p><b>Int'l MBA</b> + <b>MSc in Big Data</b> | IE Business School (Spain)</p><p><b>MSc in Industrial Engineering</b> | IMT Mines Albi-Carmaux (France)</p><p><br></p>"
        },
